            Check dependencies for known vulnerabilities?                                           
            KodeKavach can match the versions pinned in your repos' lockfiles against               
            the OSV vulnerability database, fully offline. This downloads about 300 MB              
            from osv.dev once; nothing about your repos is sent. You can do it later                
            with `chitragit audit db update`.                                                       
                                                                                                    
